\viewkind4\uc1\pard\f0\fs22 OfficeTranslate for Microsoft Office\par
\par
This installer installs the native x64 COM add-ins for Microsoft Word, Excel and PowerPoint.\par
Close all Office applications before installation. After installation completes, restart Word, Excel or PowerPoint and open the OfficeTranslate ribbon tab.\par
\par
The software is provided as-is. Configure only trusted translation service endpoints and protect your API keys.\par
